has said, \"Do not take for yourselves two deities. He [i.e., Allāh] is but one God, so fear only Me.\"","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"16:52","t":"And to Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and the earth, and to Him is [due] worship constantly. Then is it other than Allāh that you fear?","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"16:53","t":"And whatever you have of favor - it is from Allāh. Then when adversity touches you, to Him you cry for help.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"16:54","t":"Then when He removes the adversity from you, at once a party of you associates others with their Lord","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":54,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[16],"sajdah":true}